<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
    <style>
        @page {
            size: auto;
            margin: 0;
        }
        body {
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
            font-size: 12pt;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin: 1in auto;
            max-width: 8.5in;
            padding: 0.5in;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            position: relative;
        }
        /* Page content container - simulates A4 / letter margins */
        .page-content {
            position: relative;
            min-height: 11.5in;
        }
        /* Column zones - detected as 3-zone layout */
        .column {
            display: inline-block;
            vertical-align: top;
            width: 2.5in;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .column:last-child {
            width: 2.4in;
        }
        .column h1, .column h2 {
            margin: 0 0 6pt 0;
            font-size: 14pt;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .column p {
            margin: 3pt 0;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        .placeholder {
            background: #f0f0f0;
            border: 1px dashed #999;
            height: 2.2in;
            margin: 8pt 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 10pt;
            color: #666;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .placeholder img {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 100%;
        }
        .section-break {
            height: 1pt;
            background: #000;
            margin: 12pt 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page-content">

    <!-- Column 1 -->
    <div class="column">
        <h1>Sample Document Title</h1>
        <p>[illegible]</p>
        <p>This is the first line of text in column one.</p>
        <p>Second paragraph appears here with normal spacing.</p>
        <div class="placeholder">[Diagram: top-left quadrant]</div>
        <p>Text resumes after the diagram placeholder.</p>
        <p>More content follows in the same column.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 2 -->
    <div class="column">
        <h2>Subheading</h2>
        <p>Text in the second column, aligned to the left margin.</p>
        <p>Longer text block to demonstrate wrapping behavior.</p>
        <div class="placeholder">[Chart: middle-right]</div>
        <p>Additional text after the chart placeholder.</p>
        <p>End of second column content.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 3 -->
    <div class="column">
        <p>Text in the third column.</p>
        <p>Short paragraph for balance.</p>
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: bottom-left]</div>
        <p>Final line of text in the document.</p>
        <p>[illegible] text segment.</p>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
```
